                  "oneOfCase": "RRT_V2_BLOCK_ELEMENTS_JSON",
                  "rrtV2BlockElementsJson": "{\"children\":[[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"A: Hi. I just moved into the apartment building across the street, and I’m interested in using your pool.\\nB: Okay. We offer daily swimming lessons, or you can get a pass for the open swim periods.\\nA: I just need the general pass. I plan on swimming early in the morning, before I go to work.\\nB: Well, you can see here that we have two morning options. But it sounds like you’ll be done by eight o’clock.\\nA: That’s right. So, I might as well get the shorter pass. It’s less expensive, right?\\nB: Yes, it is. Also, it’s a good idea to get an on-site locker. We rent them for just ten dollars a month.\"}]]}]]}"
                }
